+---
+id: task-001-give-each-task-a-unique-id
+type: task
+title: "Give each task a unique id"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Each task now has an `id` (`task-1`, `task-2`, ...), assigned by the list on `add` and kept when the
+task is renamed. `TaskList.get(id)` returns the task as a Result (`not-found` otherwise). `find`,
+`complete`, `reopen`, `rename`, `tag`, `untag` and `remove` accept a title or an id. Tests added in
+`test/list.test.ts`; `npm test` passes. See dl-001.
